# ## 1. Project Overview
# This project provides a flexible framework for analyzing Sea Surface Temperature (SST) patterns across the Indian Ocean region. The analysis incorporates:
# - Seasonal temperature cycle detection
# - Regional temperature pattern analysis
# - Enhanced geographical visualization
# - Statistical analysis with proper spatial weighting
# - Support for multiple data formats and resolutions
# 
# ### Key Features
# - Flexible data file selection with size information
# - Seasonal cycle detection and visualization
# - Regional focus (Full Indian Ocean, Arabian Sea, Bay of Bengal)
# - Enhanced geographical features using Cartopy
# - Automated output generation with timestamps
# 
# ## 2. Setup and Dependencies
# 
